  "description": "Create stunning, realistic Dalmatian textures with this seamless Procreate brush! Perfect for digital artists, illustrators, and designers, this brush adds natural, organic animal skin patterns to your artwork effortlessly. Whether you’re working on pet portraits, fashion illustrations, or creative textures, this brush will give your designs a bold, eye-catching look.\n✨ What’s Included:\n✔ 1 Seamless Dalmatian Texture Procreate Brush\n✔ High-quality, smooth, and realistic animal skin pattern\n🎨 How to Use:\nDownload the brush file after purchase.\nOpen Procreate on your iPad.\nTap the Brush Library and import the brush.\nSelect the brush and start painting for a seamless, textured effect!\nAdjust size, opacity, and pressure for different results.\n🔹 Perfect For:\n✔ Digital painting & illustrations\n✔ Animal-themed designs & fashion artwork\n✔ Background textures & custom patterns\n✔ Tattoo designs, graphic design & sublimation art",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create stunning, realistic Dalmatian textures with this seamless Procreate brush! Perfect for digital artists, illustrators, and designers, this brush adds natural, organic animal skin patterns to your artwork effortlessly. Whether you’re working on pet portraits, fashion illustrations, or creative textures, this brush will give your designs a bold, eye-catching look.</p>\n<p>✨ What’s Included:<br>\n✔ 1 Seamless Dalmatian Texture Procreate Brush<br>\n✔ High-quality, smooth, and realistic animal skin pattern</p>\n<p>🎨 How to Use:</p>\n<p>Download the brush file after purchase.<br>\nOpen Procreate on your iPad.<br>\nTap the Brush Library and import the brush.<br>\nSelect the brush and start painting for a seamless, textured effect!<br>\nAdjust size, opacity, and pressure for different results.</p>\n<p>🔹 Perfect For:<br>\n✔ Digital painting &amp; illustrations<br>\n✔ Animal-themed designs &amp; fashion artwork<br>\n✔ Background textures &amp; custom patterns<br>\n✔ Tattoo designs, graphic design &amp; sublimation art</p>",
